      "value": "@{62b61f8ec938a62475e4cd14|full_name} Additional Observations\n\nLooking at the broken rendering on the custom font canvas, the missing glyph blocks are not uniform, they vary in width depending on the character. \n\nThis suggests that TextMeshPro's layout engine is successfully looking up the fallback font sizes but something after that point fails.",
